    "body": "ChatGPT review at exact HEAD `dfcf7095fc0441a9b61833dbc6cb19e16972c09f`: the redundant `vote.prompt` pill is removed from active Events and battle vote renderers, including Rayhan pending vote. The non-player `Смотри исход` status and escape-specific questions remain. NPC draw SYS message no longer appends the generic vote prompt. Scope: 4 runtime files + 4 exact docs mirrors + 3 tests. Verified the four runtime/docs pairs have identical Git blob hashes and PR is mergeable. Executed static regression checks and syntax were reported PASS by Codex; GitHub `ai-forensics-evidence` SUCCESS (run `38431366392`); `telemetry-receiver-checks` did not trigger on this head. The original strings still live in profile dictionaries but there are no remaining active vote-prompt renderer references in the reviewed source. This is CODE REVIEW PASS, not a public Safari PASS. Guarded squash merge into main is approved; postmerge Pages verification and separate user Safari acceptance follow.",
