    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## Summary\n- Remove the generic profile-specific vote prompt pill from Events and battle draw/escape vote cards.\n- Preserve escape action prompts, Oleg's Уйти/Остаться labels, vote controls, counters, timers, training vote blocking, and non-player draw status.\n- Remove the redundant prompt from NPC draw announcements and keep all four Web/docs mirrors identical.\n- Add Issue #423 regression coverage across five UI profiles and ordinary, NPC, Rayhan, Nastya, and Oleg vote surfaces.\n\n## Validation\n- `python3 tools/test_issue_423_vote_prompt_absent.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage6_step9_five_profile_runtime_defects.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage6_step9_profile_bootstrap_findings.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_23_nastya_crowd_vote.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_24_nastya_vote_timing.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_31_oleg_escape_lifecycle.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_40_generic_events.py`\n- `node --check` on all four changed runtime mirror pairs; `git diff --check`; byte parity for each Web/docs pair.\n\nCloses #423. Draft for review; no merge or runtime acceptance claimed.",
